      "document_id": "253",
      "explanation": "Directly engages the Attorney General's proposals to 'strike the weapons from their hands,' 'cut off the underworld supply of guns,' and have legislators 'prevent the sale of deadly weapons to criminals.' The editorial argues such laws cannot work—advocacy against regulation, which the clarification explicitly includes. Fits the definition's debate over laws controlling sale and possession.",
