    },
    {
      "document_id": "269",
      "explanation": "A call to organize against proposed anti-gun laws in Congress and 47 state legislatures, with a five-part 'test of a gun law.' Directly discusses firearms legislation and advocacy against it—clarification items (1) and (2). Clear positive.",
