    },
    {
      "document_id": "270",
      "explanation": "A Thanksgiving/Armistice Day essay and nonpartisan civic-duty appeal to vote. Patriotic/holiday essays and general electioneering without gun-law content are excluded; firearms are never mentioned in a regulatory context.",
